  "hints": ["Ladders are best saved for the biggest climbs, but you only know which climbs are biggest later. Keep the climbs that use a ladder so far in a NEW MIN HEAP.", "INSERT every climb. IF there are now more climbs than ladders, the smallest of them must use bricks instead: TAKE TOP it and take that many bricks away.", "IF the bricks go below 0, you cannot reach the next building: RETURN where you are."],
